From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iris <dev@iris.local>
Subject: Add token-scoped embedder video Picture in Picture admission

Carry a browser-only request identity through media IPC, preserving untagged
manual sessions and checking the embedder before creating a player.
Ported to Chromium 156 pending-session and immersive-confirmation flow.

